# Task 149-008: Scope Sanitizer Code Snippet False Positive Fix

## Problem
DIRECTIVES markdown parse edilirken code block içindeki örnek dosya yolları (src/foo.ts, .directories, .some) yanlışlıkla filesWrite'a giriyor.

## Approach

### 1. scope-sanitizer.ts — 3 yeni filter rule ekle (Rule 9, 10, 11)
- Rule 9: JS property access pattern reject (`.directories`, `.some`, `.length`)
- Rule 10: Placeholder filename reject (`foo.ts`, `bar.js`, `example.ts`, `test.ts`)
- Rule 11: Export helper functions `isPlaceholderPath()` and `isJsAccessPattern()`

### 2. task-builder.ts — Code block masking
- `parseStructuredDirectives()` ve `parseBulletOrNumberedTasks()` içinde code fence masking
- Regex: /```[\s\S]*?```/g ile code block'ları mask et
- `extractScopeFromDirective()` sadece mask-dışı text'e uygulanacak
- Helper: `maskCodeBlocks(content)` fonksiyonu

### 3. tests/orchestra/scope-sanitizer-v2.test.ts — 8 test
- DIRECTIVES ile code block içi path filter
- Placeholder path reject
- JS access pattern reject
- Real paths preserved
- Sprint 148 T-002 replay

## Files to Modify
- src/orchestra/scope-sanitizer.ts (add rules 9-11)
- src/orchestra/task-builder.ts (add code block masking)
- tests/orchestra/scope-sanitizer-v2.test.ts (NEW — 8 tests)

## Verify
- tsc --noEmit
- npx vitest run tests/orchestra/scope-sanitizer-v2.test.ts
- npx vitest run tests/orchestra/scope-sanitizer.test.ts (existing tests still pass)
